628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2057 0 R
/E (Zero Critical or Blocker Bugs: No open defects with "Critical" or "Blocker" priority are allowed in the final report. Any such issues discovered during testing must be either resolved and verified or officially deferred by the product management with a documented workaround.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
629 0 obj
<<
